{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/52644f30632509f1b93cc7e159f893d9.avif?t=1760010756\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1760010756\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall repetitively. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/81682b8de3614764efcfc9a20d3facc0.avif?t=1760010756\" width=1560 height=940 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1760010756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1760010756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/dc1bdb6d4b84624ebeac145d8335e63551a1398a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760010756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/dc1bdb6d4b84624ebeac145d8335e63551a1398a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760010756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3855260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/52644f30632509f1b93cc7e159f893d9.avif?t=1760010756\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1760010756\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall repetitively. Place turrets to defend your town h